  Name: Survivor
  Description: 'The hero: it walks where it''s told, each ability of the pool it
    holds casts itself as its cooldown ends, and its dash waits for Space. It starts
    with Arcane Bolt and its dash; level-ups teach it more, to five, and boss waves
    give it passives, to five.'
